        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### CPU / memory / disk\n\nAutopilot node & pod saturation lives in **GCP Cloud Monitoring** (not shipped to Grafana by design).\n\nCheck:\n- GKE \u2192 Workloads \u2192 CPU / Memory\n- Cloud Monitoring \u2192 `kubernetes.io/container/*`\n\nAlerting for infra remains in Terraform (`observability_gcp`)."
